---
<section class="py-24 bg-gray-50 border-y border-gray-200">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-green-700 tracking-widest uppercase mb-2">The Material Advantage</h2>
      <h3 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900">Why Switch to EcoLyf Bagasse?</h3>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-xl border border-red-100 shadow-sm opacity-75">
        <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2">Styrofoam (EPS)</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-gray-600">
          <li class="flex items-center text-red-600"><span class="mr-2">✗</span> Takes 500+ years to degrade</li>
          <li class="flex items-center text-red-600"><span class="mr-2">✗</span> Leaches toxins when heated</li>
          <li class="flex items-center text-red-600"><span class="mr-2">✗</span> Facing global government bans</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-xl border border-yellow-200 shadow-sm opacity-75">
        <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2">Standard Plastic</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-gray-600">
          <li class="flex items-center text-yellow-600"><span class="mr-2">⚠</span> Recyclable, but rarely recycled</li>
          <li class="flex items-center text-yellow-600"><span class="mr-2">⚠</span> Massive carbon manufacturing footprint</li>
          <li class="flex items-center text-yellow-600"><span class="mr-2">⚠</span> Brittle under extreme cold</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-green-900 p-8 rounded-xl border-2 border-green-500 shadow-xl transform md:-translate-y-4">
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 bg-green-500 text-white text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-bl-lg rounded-tr-lg">INDUSTRY STANDARD</div>
        <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4 border-b border-green-700 pb-2">EcoLyf Bagasse</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-green-100 font-medium">
          <li class="flex items-center"><span class="mr-2 text-green-400">✓</span> 100% Compostable in 90 Days</li>
          <li class="flex items-center"><span class="mr-2 text-green-400">✓</span> Microwave Safe (up to 120°C)</li>
          <li class="flex items-center"><span class="mr-2 text-green-400">✓</span> Zero toxins, PFAS-free options</li>
          <li class="flex items-center"><span class="mr-2 text-green-400">✓</span> Premium tactile strength</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>